  "description": "SEWROF crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: (C46 H58 Dy5 N3 O24)n. From the CIF bond table, Dy4 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy5 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy1 (Dy) has 5 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy5_2 (Dy) has 1 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 9 pairs, 2 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.572-3.841 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 94.75-112.30°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Dy5(L)(μ4-O)(μ3-OH)(μ-OCH3)2(CH3COO)7]. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 1 μ4-O (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 1 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
